              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jessicay"
            },
            "reviewBody": "What an AMAZING tzimmes. When I was cooking it, it looked so uninspiring... but as that hour of simmering passed, my goodness, it starts to smell incredible. By the end it, it was just incredible. ONE SUBSTITUTION, ONE CHANGE: apricots instead of prunes, 2/3 the sugar.",
            "datePublished": "2012-04-08T09:00:21.160Z"
          },
          {
